# Environment variables for the Serra Cross Park site.
# Copy to .env for local work. Never commit .env; .gitignore already keeps it out.
# On Netlify, set variables in the Netlify UI (Site configuration, Environment variables), never in the repo.

# Cal.com API key. Leave empty. The availability function calls Cal.com's public slots API,
# which answers without a key (checked 2026-10-09). Only set this if Cal.com starts refusing
# anonymous slot requests with 401 or 403; the function then sends it as a bearer token.
CAL_API_KEY=
